---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/scenes/Hero.astro';
import WhyNow from '../components/scenes/WhyNow.astro';
import MethodScene from '../components/scenes/MethodScene.astro';
import PilotsScene from '../components/scenes/PilotsScene.astro';
import ForumScene from '../components/scenes/ForumScene.astro';
import PeopleScene from '../components/scenes/PeopleScene.astro';
---
<!-- Six beats. No two adjacent scenes land at the same weight, on the same
     ground, or in the same composition:
       Hero      photograph · poster left, named ledger low     100svh
       WhyNow    cream · narrow left column, vertical rule, claim right
       Method    ink-900 · CENTRED — the only centred scene on the site
       Pilots    ink-900 · the long ledger, flush left
       Forum     photograph · the room                           94svh
       People    ink-900 head, then a full-bleed ink-800 WALL of names

     THREE ARMATURES, not one. The site's default move — micro label at the
     left rail, hairline ruled the full frame, block hung beneath — belongs
     to Hero, Pilots and Forum. WhyNow turns it ninety degrees (the division
     is vertical, the major column is the right one). Method abandons the
     left edge entirely and sets on the centre line. Method and Pilots are
     consecutive and used to open identically; they no longer share a mark.

     TWO TONAL EVENTS, spaced. Cream at 16% of the scroll (WhyNow) and the
     ink-800 board wall at 76% (People). The photograph at 0% and the
     photograph at 54% sit between them. The back half used to hold one
     value for 1,700px; it does not now. Ground changes stay inside the
     three-per-page budget: cream, panel, and the two full-bleed frames.

     Method precedes Pilots so the abstract is spent before the concrete
     arrives, and so the densest scene runs straight into the photograph.
     The People wall runs flush into the footer, so the page ends on a hard
     tonal edge rather than on 290px of empty navy. -->
<Base>
  <Hero />
  <WhyNow />
  <MethodScene />
  <PilotsScene />
  <ForumScene />
  <PeopleScene />
</Base>
